1
00:00:00,552 --> 00:00:03,830
az du host gegangen f- tsu di,

2
00:00:03,830 --> 00:00:06,176
an andere lager in PoylnD,

3
00:00:06,176 --> 00:00:11,399
vi azoy hostu gegangen fun ⟨di⟩, fun eyne lager tsu di andere lager?

4
00:00:11,399 --> 00:00:15,854
un oykhet ikh vil fregn dir, hostu gehat falshe nomen, hostu

5
00:00:15,854 --> 00:00:17,837
ibergehat a falshe nomen?

6
00:00:18,051 --> 00:00:18,585
o.

7
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,584
mayn falsher nomen...

8
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:26,702
tsulib vos hob ikh gedarft dem falshn nomen?

9
00:00:27,501 --> 00:00:33,050
far mayne khaveyrim, velkhe l- zaynen, lebn mir,

10
00:00:33,475 --> 00:00:39,880
oder me darf epes farshraybn dortn o oyf aroysrufn. mir hobn nokh lekhat- l-

11
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,243
bikhlal nokh nit gehat keyn nomer.

12
00:00:43,363 --> 00:00:45,436
a nomer hot men undz gegebn

13
00:00:45,436 --> 00:00:49,720
in CHENSTOKHOV. mir hobn shoyn keyn nemen nit gehat; dortn hobn mir gehat nomern,

14
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:54,444
un do nokh nit. bi- in Rusland hobn mir nokh keyn nomern nit gehat.

15
00:00:54,568 --> 00:00:56,688
mir hobn gedarft hobn undzere nemen.

16
00:00:57,403 --> 00:00:59,028
ikh hob zikh dermont...

17
00:00:59,028 --> 00:01:00,435
mir hot a zog geton

18
00:01:00,863 --> 00:01:03,709
m- mayner a soldat... er iz geven der,

19
00:01:04,069 --> 00:01:07,150
 VODITEL' fun der, funem traktor...

20
00:01:07,157 --> 00:01:11,538
zogt er, "MIKHAIL BORISOVICH, VOZ'MITE," zogt er, "IMYA

21
00:01:12,304 --> 00:01:15,622
VOSTOCHNYKH NATSIONAL'NOSTEY. VAS ZHE," zogt er, "UB'YUT."

22
00:01:15,915 --> 00:01:19,010
"nem," zogt er, "a nomen

23
00:01:19,257 --> 00:01:22,778
fun di VOSTOCHishe natsyonalitetn.

24
00:01:23,037 --> 00:01:25,830
dir vet men dokh hargenen.",

25
00:01:26,968 --> 00:01:31,248
ikh hob zikh dermont vegn maynem a khaver, mit velkhn ikh hob zikh gelernt

26
00:01:31,322 --> 00:01:34,623
in Ades in militer-shul.

27
00:01:34,849 --> 00:01:37,222
mir hobn zikh beyde beser fun alemen gelernt.

28
00:01:37,617 --> 00:01:41,730
er iz a profesor's a zun fun ROSTOV, an ARMYANIN.

29
00:01:41,768 --> 00:01:44,462
zayn FAMILY iz geven SARKISYAN.

30
00:01:46,948 --> 00:01:49,709
kurts geredt, ikh hob zikh gegebn oto dem nomen.

31
00:01:50,340 --> 00:01:51,847
ikh gedenk az

32
00:01:51,847 --> 00:01:53,695
zayn mame flegt im aroysshikn

33
00:01:53,695 --> 00:01:55,599
sheyne pasilkes gute,

34
00:01:55,639 --> 00:01:58,485
flegn mir in eynem dos, zey oyfesn.

35
00:01:59,031 --> 00:02:02,073
 UNK ikh hob zikh ge-...

36
00:02:02,073 --> 00:02:04,577
me fregt, vi iz mayn nomen? SARKISYAN.

37
00:02:04,718 --> 00:02:07,300
SARKISYAN MIKHAIL.

38
00:02:07,418 --> 00:02:11,810
NAPRIMER, oto dem, SARKISYAN hot men gerufn LЁV⟨e⟩, an ARMYANIN LЁVA.

39
00:02:11,810 --> 00:02:14,887
ikh hob a mol gemeynt az LЁVA iz nor a yidisher nomen,

40
00:02:15,636 --> 00:02:17,554
ober ot zest dokh...

41
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:21,131
i⟨z⟩ hob ikh zikh, fleg ikh zogn az ikh bin SARKISYAN.

42
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,594
kurts geredt,

43
00:02:24,073 --> 00:02:26,930
vos zol ikh zikh farhaltn oyf dem DNEPROPETROVSK?

44
00:02:26,930 --> 00:02:30,390
mit mayne iberlebungen, yeder sh- yeder sho iz a iberlebung.

45
00:02:30,390 --> 00:02:32,504
yeder minut iz dortn a iberlebung.

46
00:02:32,545 --> 00:02:34,820
imetser ken a zog ton; ikh bin dokh KRUGO-

47
00:02:34,820 --> 00:02:37,850
ikh bin arumgeringlt mit,

48
00:02:37,850 --> 00:02:41,229
 di vos kenen epes oyf mir on- a zog ton.

49
00:02:41,809 --> 00:02:48,620
nit, nit, me, bikhlal darf er afile nit visn vos ikh bin a yid. er ken hobn a khshad,

50
00:02:48,660 --> 00:02:51,510
a trakht ton, "efsher iz er a yid,"

51
00:02:51,510 --> 00:02:54,597
ken er a zog ton, dem politsyant

52
00:02:54,597 --> 00:02:59,724
oder aleyn dem doytsh, un fartik. me git dokh far deroyf a, a matone.

53
00:03:00,675 --> 00:03:02,896
me git a bulke b- a lebl broyt.

54
00:03:03,173 --> 00:03:06,780
farshteyst? tsi epes a ander zakh hot men.

55
00:03:08,286 --> 00:03:12,220
me hot undz arayngehakt vayter in di vagonen.

56
00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:15,360
mir zaynen durkhgegangen, TAK SKAZAT', frier zaynen mir durkh

57
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:19,265
durkhn, shtot DNEPROPETROVSK, shoyn geven a d- a tseklapte.

58
00:03:21,448 --> 00:03:24,277
VOT, m'hot undz arayngetribn in di vagonen,

59
00:03:24,891 --> 00:03:28,158
un me hot undz geb- gebrakht tsu firn

60
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:30,471
in shtot CHENSTOKHOV.

61
00:03:31,590 --> 00:03:33,266
zogndik in veg,

62
00:03:33,266 --> 00:03:35,769
beys mir zaynen, flegn forn in veg,

63
00:03:36,265 --> 00:03:44,570
iz geven a groyse ZAPAKH, BOL'SHOY, fun, di luft iz geven a dershtikte.

64
00:03:44,736 --> 00:03:46,485
s'iz geven zumer.

65
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:50,950
s'iz fardreyt di tirn mit drot.

66
00:03:51,047 --> 00:03:54,000
⟨di k- fe-⟩ di fentsterl iz oykh farklapt.

67
00:03:54,422 --> 00:03:55,752
un me fort.

68
00:03:55,752 --> 00:03:59,338
di parashe shteyt lebn, lebn tir.

69
00:03:59,338 --> 00:04:02,110
es geyt fun ir a groyse ETO.

70
00:04:02,110 --> 00:04:06,410
mir zaynen ongeshtikte, eyne lebn di andere. ale

71
00:04:07,078 --> 00:04:10,987
tsvishn zikh reydn, vos gikher, vos gikher kumen tsu an ort,

72
00:04:11,567 --> 00:04:15,220
un ikh trakht, "khalt zikh tsien di veg

73
00:04:15,220 --> 00:04:19,670
bizl sof lebn, zol zikh tsien un tsien, vorem do

74
00:04:19,853 --> 00:04:23,663
veys ikh az ikh'l lebn azoy vi oto der vos ligt do o,

75
00:04:23,663 --> 00:04:28,824
azoy vi oto der vos ligt, hob ikh di zelbe zakh tsum lebn vi er.

76
00:04:29,404 --> 00:04:33,470
ober az ikh vel kumen ahin vayter, zukht men yidn.

77
00:04:33,488 --> 00:04:38,325
ikh bin dokh in a kleynem, ikh gefin zikh in a kleynem mehalekh.

78
00:04:39,023 --> 00:04:44,090
on-o zogt men, er hot zikh gef⟨i⟩nen oyf der, doy- oyf,

79
00:04:44,090 --> 00:04:47,184
der teritorye vu der doytsh hot farkhapt,

80
00:04:47,410 --> 00:04:50,630
iz oykh gibn zey hilf, di NEMTSes, dem

81
00:04:50,630 --> 00:04:52,680
yidn velkher ken dervayzn

82
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:57,073
az er iz geven ergets dortn ⟨b-,⟩ in derfer, in velder, in ETO.

83
00:04:57,366 --> 00:05:01,990
nor ikh bin geven in a kleyner mehalekh arumgeringlt.

84
00:05:01,990 --> 00:05:04,920
KRUGOM iz faran sonim a velt,

85
00:05:06,090 --> 00:05:08,989
vos kenen oyf mir epes fardinen:

86
00:05:08,989 --> 00:05:11,419
i fardinen, a matone,

87
00:05:11,419 --> 00:05:13,460
itster, khuts deroyf,

88
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:15,618
iz ot aza min,

89
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:18,251
 PREDATEL', aza min oysvurf,

90
00:05:18,308 --> 00:05:25,830
iz nemen zey tsu fun lager, me git im nokh a, a shtele avelkhe nit iz, a farretershe.

91
00:05:27,184 --> 00:05:31,194
in CHENSTOKHOV hot men undz gebrakht in a, in a lager,

92
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:36,763
un epes shteyt dortn o eyn, tsvey, blokn.

93
00:05:37,231 --> 00:05:38,570
in Poyln⟨D⟩?

94
00:05:38,183 --> 00:05:39,344
in Poyln.

95
00:05:39,790 --> 00:05:47,060
di shtot iz geven, CHENSTOKHOV. mir zeen, zi iz a gantse, nit keyn tseklapte, un epes a reyne, antkegn di,

96
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:49,892
 dortn, di vos geven in Rusland.

97
00:05:50,337 --> 00:05:52,862
keyn flier hobn ir nit geklapt.

98
00:05:54,606 --> 00:06:00,945
⟨ersht hot men⟩ glaykh gefregt⟨, d-⟩ gekumen in CHENSTOKHOV, iz zi geven tseteylt m- mit drot oyf tsvey helft,

99
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:05,170
oyf tsvey helft, tsvey b- tsvey blokn geven.

100
00:06:05,777 --> 00:06:09,078
VOT. iz in hoyf hot men undz arayngefirt,

101
00:06:09,540 --> 00:06:12,099
un m'hot opgetseylt do draysik man,

102
00:06:12,898 --> 00:06:16,233
un m'hot geheysn, m'hot arayngefirt, otpravet ahin o.

103
00:06:17,151 --> 00:06:21,510
nu, bay mir, di harts oto do o dreyt, kimert.

104
00:06:22,500 --> 00:06:26,430
dos hot men avekgefirt in, in a bod, me zogt, V BANYU.

105
00:06:27,748 --> 00:06:30,307
⟨m'hot oyf⟩geefnt a tirl fun, fun drot

106
00:06:30,533 --> 00:06:34,054
un m'hot o- der vakh-man hot opgeteylt draysik man

107
00:06:34,195 --> 00:06:36,467
un hot opgefirt in, in a bod.

108
00:06:38,650 --> 00:06:42,240
mir hobn zikh dervart, ikh hob zikh kam dervart, vos iz dortn?

109
00:06:42,919 --> 00:06:44,685
aroysgegangen di ershte.

110
00:06:45,147 --> 00:06:47,183
eyner iz tsugegangen tsum ployt

111
00:06:48,015 --> 00:06:50,155
un zogt, "KHOROSHO. NAS,

112
00:06:50,155 --> 00:06:52,936
MY POMYLIS' KHOROSHO. NAS OBSTRIGLI."

113
00:06:53,027 --> 00:06:56,092
"mir hobn zikh gut oysgevashn. m'hot undz arumgeshert."

114
00:06:56,368 --> 00:06:59,771
"ESHCHЁ BALANDU DALI." "m'hot nokh gegebn BALANDA."

115
00:06:59,828 --> 00:07:01,425
BALANDA, dos iz a sup,

116
00:07:01,465 --> 00:07:06,859
vu dortn flien, dortn a por groypn mit a por UNK,

117
00:07:07,033 --> 00:07:08,782
 sholekhts fun bulbes.

118
00:07:09,092 --> 00:07:10,588
"I KUSOK KHLEBA."

119
00:07:10,915 --> 00:07:13,018
ale z- zaynen tsufridn.

120
00:07:13,058 --> 00:07:14,638
ale tsufridn!

121
00:07:14,847 --> 00:07:16,478
bay mir di harts

122
00:07:16,787 --> 00:07:19,396
klapt. demolt hob ikh derfilt di harts.

123
00:07:19,977 --> 00:07:21,439
ikh bin geven a gezunter.

124
00:07:22,137 --> 00:07:24,325
un do hob ikh derfilt di harts.

125
00:07:25,650 --> 00:07:27,024
zi klemt.

126
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,943
farshteyst? klemt di harts.

127
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:33,892
⟨i-⟩ trakht ikh vayter, geyn der ershter

128
00:07:35,164 --> 00:07:39,920
iz tor men nit, vorem dem ersht- di ershte zukht men,

129
00:07:39,957 --> 00:07:42,296
mit groyse gefil.

130
00:07:42,505 --> 00:07:45,553
der letster iz oykhet a,

131
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:51,611
a ⟨khash-⟩ a ⟨khashore⟩, me ken, zey kenen, gut tsukukn zikh.

132
00:07:51,904 --> 00:07:53,383
trakht ikh, ergets

133
00:07:53,963 --> 00:07:55,796
a bisinke vayter fun mitn.

134
00:07:56,545 --> 00:07:59,543
un mayn, bay mir iz shoyn a nayer khaver faran, MELKONYAN...

135
00:08:00,342 --> 00:08:04,031
der hot zikh gerufn andersh, ⟨darf zikh⟩ dermonen, GOSPO- got mayner...

136
00:08:04,324 --> 00:08:10,072
MELKONYAN iz shoyn mit mir... a kleyner ARMYANIN ROSTOM. er iz geven, a KOMANDIR POLKA,

137
00:08:10,163 --> 00:08:13,330
⟨a k-⟩ a polkovnik, a groyser mentsh.

138
00:08:13,555 --> 00:08:18,268
nor er, ikh hob zikh mit im tsunoyfgegangen. er iz a patryotisher,

139
00:08:18,268 --> 00:08:21,159
er iz geven a, a k- komunist.

140
00:08:21,874 --> 00:08:25,412
ikh hob farshtanen, ⟨er vet mir ni-, ON MEN-⟩ er vet mir nit aroysgebn.

141
00:08:26,565 --> 00:08:30,380
kurts geredt, ⟨S-⟩ zogt tsu mir MELKONYAN,

142
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:32,161
 "MISHKA, POSHLI!"

143
00:08:32,740 --> 00:08:36,640
"M- MISHA, avekgegangen! kum fun di ershte!"

144
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:42,146
ikh hob shoyn do d- di, mayn kop flit shoyn ⟨i-⟩ arumet umedum,

145
00:08:42,146 --> 00:08:45,521
un ikh bin nit gegangen fun di ershte. er iz avekgegangen.

146
00:08:45,521 --> 00:08:48,120
⟨ikh bin⟩ geblibn ergets fun hintn.

147
00:08:48,216 --> 00:08:51,240
m'hot ibergeteylt -tseylt undzer draysikl...

148
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:55,331
DA! hot er gezogt, ⟨"NO..."⟩ yener, kh'hob dir fargesn zogn....

149
00:08:55,405 --> 00:08:57,272
CHTO "BALANDU DAYUT,

150
00:08:57,750 --> 00:08:59,600
TOL'KO ZHIDOV ISHCHUT."

151
00:09:01,852 --> 00:09:03,640
dos hob ikh fargesn zogn,

152
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:05,710
 di kleynikeyt hob ikh fargesn zogn.

153
00:09:05,710 --> 00:09:07,670
"TAM KHOROSHO, TOL'KO ZHIDOV ISHCHUT."

154
00:09:07,830 --> 00:09:12,270
 kurts geredt, UNK ikh muz dokh geyn.

155
00:09:12,482 --> 00:09:15,766
ikh bin avekgegangen. ikh lo- farloz zikh oyf got.

156
00:09:16,684 --> 00:09:24,300
⟨NADO DAT' BY,⟩, ODNO, ZNACHIT, sh-, shvue,

157
00:09:24,615 --> 00:09:26,482
dos iz keseyder geven bay mir,

158
00:09:26,893 --> 00:09:28,473
zol ikh azoy lebn.

159
00:09:30,319 --> 00:09:35,170
ikh fleg⟨, her zikh ayn,⟩ zogn, zogn a mitsve.

160
00:09:36,225 --> 00:09:43,090
ikh gey un ikh halt in eyn reydn in zikh ot di mitsve. mentshn z- ikh z- dertseyl dos nit, vorem,

161
00:09:43,090 --> 00:09:48,251
vorem UNK BOL'SH- iber hoypt gleybt men nit in got, nor in aza tsore

162
00:09:48,679 --> 00:09:51,305
hob, fleg ikh zogn di mitsve vos mayn,

163
00:09:51,328 --> 00:09:56,691
vos der RABBI un di, di bobe hobn mir UNK fleg, di bobe fleg ⟨zi⟩ farn shlofn mir heysn zogn:

164
00:09:56,691 --> 00:10:02,105
SHMA YISROEL ADOYNOY ELOYHEYNU ADOYNOY EKHOD. BORUKH SHEYM KEVOYD MALKHUSOY LEOYLOM VOED.

165
00:10:02,162 --> 00:10:03,725
"eybershter, helf!

166
00:10:04,086 --> 00:10:07,472
makh a sof fun di gazlonim un loz mir lebn."

167
00:10:07,815 --> 00:10:13,715
un ikh fleg geyn⟨, herst,⟩ un dos flegt bay mir geyn in kop un flegt mir opvendn fun andere zakhn.

168
00:10:14,447 --> 00:10:17,006
dos flegt mir aynhaltn fun shrek.

169
00:10:18,177 --> 00:10:21,090
dos iz an emes, azoy vi du zest mir.

170
00:10:21,619 --> 00:10:25,275
di gantse tsayt, ikh fleg geyn un zogn ot di reyd.

171
00:10:25,956 --> 00:10:28,680
ikh hob shtark nit gevust vos heysn zey,

172
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:31,518
nor ikh hob zey oysgelernt az ikh bin geven a kleyn kind.

173
00:10:32,554 --> 00:10:35,830
SHMA YISROEL ADOYNOY ELOYHEYNU, ADOYNOY EKHOD, un fartik.

174
00:10:36,672 --> 00:10:42,271
un ikh gey arayn⟨et⟩, hot men undz geheysn, s'iz geven an ersht der arayngang, hot men geheysn oyston zikh in gantsn

175
00:10:42,271 --> 00:10:47,740
un araynvarfn di zakhn in aza min, kamer fun tsigl,

176
00:10:48,332 --> 00:10:57,590
kedey i- iberbrenen di, di... di zakhn iz geven mit layz un mit floyen alerleyike⟨, zol⟩ dos iberbrenen.

177
00:10:58,035 --> 00:11:01,049
un fun di shikh alts a- aroysgevorfn.

178
00:11:01,461 --> 00:11:05,370
un, geven shoyn in a tsveytn tsimer geyn,

179
00:11:05,595 --> 00:11:10,398
iz dortn in dem tsveytn tsimer shert men shoyn arum. se zitsn dray PARIKMAKHERes,

180
00:11:10,557 --> 00:11:13,970
dray sherer, un me shert KRUGOM arum.

181
00:11:13,970 --> 00:11:16,102
un bay mir dreyt zikh di oygn,

182
00:11:16,294 --> 00:11:19,220
un ikh derze in zayt in tir...

183
00:11:19,332 --> 00:11:23,500
eyn tir iz geven, a, a klenere fun der, a shmelere, arayng⟨egangen ahin o⟩.

184
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:27,420
shteyen tsveyen: a NEMETS, un do shteyt

185
00:11:28,377 --> 00:11:31,680
a goy, a PREDATEL', a, a farreter,

186
00:11:31,853 --> 00:11:34,378
a ponem efsher a dokter, efsher ver veys,

187
00:11:34,587 --> 00:11:36,825
un yedern batrakht m⟨en hoyle⟩.

188
00:11:39,042 --> 00:11:41,460
kh'hob farlorn dem shrek.

189
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:46,880
ikh trakht nor az ikh darf nit geyn der ershter.

190
00:11:47,142 --> 00:11:49,954
mir zitsn in drayen; ikh darf geyn ergets in mitn.

191
00:11:51,664 --> 00:11:56,180
un azoy iz geven. es zaynen durkhgegangen beyde. ikh bin geblibn gor der letster.

192
00:11:57,351 --> 00:12:00,348
nor der vos iz gegangen der tsveyter hot a zog geton,

193
00:12:01,435 --> 00:12:04,800
"KAZANSKIY TATARIN." er.

194
00:12:06,025 --> 00:12:09,253
der hot zikh bay mir a freg geton... er iz shoyn arayn, yener, in bod...

195
00:12:09,253 --> 00:12:10,777
zogt er, "KTO TY?"

196
00:12:11,762 --> 00:12:14,051
der tsiviler, der rusisher.

197
00:12:14,462 --> 00:12:19,640
zog ikh, "YA ROSTOVSKIY," zog ikh, "TATARIN." mit an aktsent.

198
