Palestine. flegn zey oyfn veg ale yidn tsehargenen.

393
00:24:30,229 --> 00:24:31,790
s'iz aza folk!

394
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:35,584
di inkvizitsyes g- vos geven in, in GERMANye.

395
00:24:35,584 --> 00:24:37,817
vifl yidn hobn zey dortn tseharget?

396
00:24:39,021 --> 00:24:42,810
farshtey-...? ⟨dos zaynen⟩ punktuel. m'hot oysgearbet...

397
00:24:42,810 --> 00:24:46,210
vifl hobn zey farkhapt lender lebn zikh?

398
00:24:47,425 --> 00:24:51,536
iz a-, iz oysgearbet g- bay zey geven a punktuelkeyt.

399
00:24:51,643 --> 00:24:53,450
ot di punktuelkeyt iz,

400
00:24:53,450 --> 00:24:55,100
zey barimen zikh mit deroyf,

401
00:24:55,100 --> 00:24:56,767
nor s'iz nit keyn barimeray.

402
00:24:57,229 --> 00:25:00,250
dos iz oyf hargenen a punktuelkeyt!

403
00:25:01,650 --> 00:25:05,330
ELEGANTNe, makht er zikh ELEGANTNe,

404
00:25:05,330 --> 00:25:07,753
un er vet shmeykhlen un dir hargenen.

405
00:25:09,177 --> 00:25:14,710
kurts geredt, mir grobn di griber, a finf griber, lange, tife.

406
00:25:14,710 --> 00:25:18,170
m'hot undz geheysn tif, tsvey a halbe meter.

407
00:25:18,458 --> 00:25:23,939
mir hobn shoyn keyn koyekh nit geh⟨e⟩t, gehat aroysvarfn mit di lopetes di ⟨v-⟩ di ⟨b-⟩ di ETO.

408
00:25:23,939 --> 00:25:26,804
hobn mir, z- zey hobn undz gezogt, s'iz oyf bulbes,

409
00:25:26,980 --> 00:25:28,746
oyf bulbes farn lager.

410
00:25:29,595 --> 00:25:32,407
hobn mir farshtanen az me git undz

411
00:25:33,426 --> 00:25:37,940
a sholekhts, nor a por sholekhtsn gefinstu in der BALANDA

412
00:25:37,965 --> 00:25:41,340
in der shiterer, iz dos nit oyf bulbes!

413
00:25:42,302 --> 00:25:45,840
hobn mir farshtanen az dos iz farn geto,

414
00:25:46,015 --> 00:25:49,148
far dem geto in CHENSTOKHOV, far di yidn.

415
00:25:52,056 --> 00:25:55,600
dernokh dem, az mir hobn geendikt ot dos ton, zaynen mir

416
00:25:55,600 --> 00:25:57,697
IZMUCHet aroysgegangen tsu,

417
00:25:57,697 --> 00:26:00,009
shoyn ayngem⟨ut-⟩ ayngemidte,

418
00:26:00,009 --> 00:26:03,254
un m'hot undz geheysn oysshteln zikh, un ikh hob derzen ANTONYUKn.

419
00:26:03,970 --> 00:26:05,601
ANTONYUK hot derzen mir.

420
00:26:08,205 --> 00:26:10,004
hob, do hob ikh farshtanen...

421
00:26:15,478 --> 00:26:17,328
gut vos s'iz geven SARKISYAN.

422
00:26:18,448 --> 00:26:20,686
er iz geshtanen lebn mir un MELKONYAN.

423
00:26:22,009 --> 00:26:25,378
kh'hob opgerufn SARKISYAN in a zayt, zog ikh, "on-o oyf yenem gib a kuk.

424
00:26:25,536 --> 00:26:28,500
dos iz..." un ikh dertseyl im di mayse, hob im dertseylt.

425
00:26:29,280 --> 00:26:34,355
zogt er, "ikh nem dir tsu," zogt er. "morgn vestu zayn," zogt er, "in GOSPITAL'."

426
00:26:34,986 --> 00:26:36,212
er zogt tsu mir.

427
00:26:37,635 --> 00:26:39,958
m'hot undz gebrakht tsu tribn in lager.

428
00:26:40,487 --> 00:26:44,531
m'hot undz nor gegebn di BALANDA. ikh hob uspeyet oyfesn di BALANDA

429
00:26:45,212 --> 00:26:50,471
un ikh hob zikh avekgeleygt. ⟨fleg, ikh, ikh fleg zikh⟩ nit BOLTAen, ikh fleg nit arumgeyn ibern lager shpatsirn,

430
00:26:52,047 --> 00:26:57,424
vorem imetser zol mir nit derkenen. zey flegn ale geyn, lebn mir di ARMYANer, ale flegn avekgeyn shpatsirn.

431
00:26:58,594 --> 00:26:59,904
kurts geredt...

432
00:27:02,593 --> 00:27:04,274
a, a geshrey:

433
00:27:04,669 --> 00:27:06,435
me ruft oys mayn nomer.

434
00:27:06,863 --> 00:27:08,696
a vakh-man vart oyf mir.

435
00:27:10,862 --> 00:27:14,190
hob ikh glaykh farshtanen az ikh vel nit derlebn morgn.

436
00:27:15,874 --> 00:27:19,007
er vet mir nit tsunemen in GO- in, lazaret.

437
00:27:19,198 --> 00:27:20,778
er vet nit uspeyen shoyn.

438
00:27:21,156 --> 00:27:23,276
bin ikh aroysgegangen. vos ⟨vet er⟩ ton?

439
00:27:23,485 --> 00:27:28,325
zey flegn ⟨in la- in,⟩ nit arayngeyn, di vakh-manes, keyner, keyn NEMETS flegt nit arayngeyn in,

440
00:27:28,325 --> 00:27:31,545
in a blok, vorem s'iz geven a sakh layz mit, mit BLOKHes.

441
00:27:32,125 --> 00:27:33,722
bin ikh aroysgegangen.

442
00:27:34,470 --> 00:27:36,475
hot er a kuk geton, zogt er,

443
00:27:36,475 --> 00:27:39,318
"nomer UNK ⟨o⟩," zogt er,

444
00:27:39,318 --> 00:27:43,740
"JA, JA. GUT. GUT. VORWÄRTS."

445
00:27:43,740 --> 00:27:48,757
aza min, geshtanen aza min khazerl a geler, mit a kurnose noz azoy vi bay a khazer.

446
00:27:48,949 --> 00:27:52,532
itster bay im... ikh gedenk bay hayntikn tog vi der pizhak...

447
00:27:52,532 --> 00:27:55,052
bay im iz a groyser hintn geven, a grober,

448
00:27:55,193 --> 00:27:58,747
hob ikh a trakht geton, her zikh ayn, ikh gey oyf toyt un ikh gib a trakht,

449
00:28:00,492 --> 00:28:05,025
"⟨sh- er⟩ hot zikh ongefresn mit, mit vursht un shpek."

450
00:28:05,250 --> 00:28:07,310
vursht, dos iz kolbas, un shpek...

451
00:28:07,310 --> 00:28:11,415
di NEMTSes flegt men, DRAZNen mit a tsunemenish,

452
00:28:11,415 --> 00:28:13,159
 "vurshtnikes."

453
00:28:13,603 --> 00:28:16,668
kurts geredt, er traybt mir tsum tir,

454
00:28:18,126 --> 00:28:23,540
un der vakh-man vos shteyt dortn lebn der tir oyf, efenen un farmakhn oto do o,

455
00:28:23,540 --> 00:28:26,079
fun lager oyfn hoyf tsu der komendature,

456
00:28:26,079 --> 00:28:29,341
zogt er, "vemen firstu?" zogt er, "JUDEN.

457
00:28:29,803 --> 00:28:32,311
DAS iz VERFLUCHTEN JUDEN."

458
00:28:32,622 --> 00:28:35,771
"a," makht er, "VERFLUCHTER JUDEN!"

459
00:28:36,030 --> 00:28:39,290
VSЁ. hob ikh shoyn farshtanen...

